  "body": "Corner THAB 1,992sqm on 4 Freehold Titles\r\n\r\n63, 65 & 67(1&2) Anzac Street, Takapuna\r\n\r\n* THAB Zone\r\n* Prominent corner position with dual street frontage.\r\n* Comprising 4 Titles.\r\n* Total land area 1,992sqm.\r\n* Flat Section with Waste Water & Stormwater Connections\r\n* 4 Existing Properties sold \"as is, where is\".\r\n\r\nLocation highlights:\r\n\r\n* Zoned for Westlake Girls` High School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Takapuna Grammar School, Takapuna School.\r\n* 5 minutes to Takapuna Beach and Lake Pupuke.\r\n* 2 minutes to State Highway 1 access for convenient access to Auckland CBD and wider North Shore.\r\n* Woolworths supermarket and daily amenities located within walking distance.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a well-located, high potential site in one of Takapuna's most tightly held positions.\r\n\r\nPlease call Yimin Guo 0225220377 or Max Luo 021362666  today for more information.\r\n\r\nAll conjunctions welcome.",
